msgid "You have two main types of starting units: Female Citizens and Citizen Soldiers. Female Citizens are purely economic units; they have low health and little to no attack. Citizen Soldiers are workers by default, but in times of need, can utilize a weapon to fight. You have two categories of Citizen Soldiers: Infantry and Cavalry. Female Citizens and Infantry Citizen Soldiers can gather any land resources while Cavalry Citizen Soldiers can only gather meat from animals.\n"
